<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .line-item-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  .line-item-table td { padding: 5px 0; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for Logo/Header -->
    <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;">OHSU</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>I/we wish to make a gift/pledge in the sum of $<span data-field="pledge_amount">{{ pledge_amount }}</span> to: <span data-field="recipient_name">{{ recipient_name }}</span></p>
    <p>
      <span data-field="gift_type_1">{{ gift_type_1 }}</span> <span data-field="gift_type_1_value">{{ gift_type_1_value }}</span> OHSU Knight Cancer Institute to support the highest research and care priorities
    </p>
    <p>
      <span data-field="gift_type_2">{{ gift_type_2 }}</span> <span data-field="gift_type_2_value">{{ gift_type_2_value }}</span> Other
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">OPTION ONE: PLEDGE</h3>
    <p>Payment will begin on <span data-field="pledge_start_date">{{ pledge_start_date }}</span> and will be paid over a period of <span data-field="pledge_term_1">{{ pledge_term_1 }}</span> <span data-field="pledge_term_2">{{ pledge_term_2 }}</span> <span data-field="pledge_term_3">{{ pledge_term_3 }}</span> <span data-field="pledge_term_4">{{ pledge_term_4 }}</span> <span data-field="pledge_term_5">{{ pledge_term_5 }}</span> years.</p>
    <p>The balance will be paid in <span data-field="balance_payments">{{ balance_payments }}</span> payments of $<span data-field="balance_amount">{{ balance_amount }}</span>. Please send reminders: <span data-field="reminder_yes">{{ reminder_yes }}</span> yes <span data-field="reminder_no">{{ reminder_no }}</span> no</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">OPTION TWO: OUTRIGHT GIFT</h3>
    <p>Enclosed is the gift in full in the amount of $<span data-field="outright_gift_amount">{{ outright_gift_amount }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">METHOD OF PAYMENT</h3>
    <table class="line-item-table">
      <tr>
        <td>Check enclosed (made payable to: OHSUF or DCHF)</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Please charge my:</td>
        <td>
          <input type="checkbox" id="american_express"><label for="american_express">American Express</label>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td>
          <input type="checkbox" id="discover"><label for="discover">Discover</label>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td>
          <input type="checkbox" id="mastercard"><label for="mastercard">MasterCard</label>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td>
          <input type="checkbox" id="visa"><label for="visa">Visa</label>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Signature _________________________ Exp. date: <span data-field="expiration_date">{{ expiration_date }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">DONOR INFORMATION</h3>
    <p>Name(s): (Dr./Mr./Mrs./Ms.) <span data-field="donor_name">{{ donor_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="donor_address">{{ donor_address }}</span></p>
    <p>City/state/zip: <span data-field="donor_city_state_zip">{{ donor_city_state_zip }}</span></p>
    <p>E-mail: <span data-field="donor_email">{{ donor_email }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <p>Donor Signature _________________________</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Date _________________________</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3 style="margin-bottom: 10px;">HONORARY OR MEMORIAL GIFT</h3>
    <p>This gift is: <input type="checkbox" id="in_memory"><label for="in_memory">in memory of</label> <input type="checkbox" id="in_honor"><label for="in_honor">in honor of</label></p>
    <p>Name: <span data-field="honoree_name">{{ honoree_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Please send a letter informing the following of this gift (gift amount will not be included in message)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 20px;" data-field="name">{{ name }}</div>
    <p>What is the letter recipient's relationship to the honoree/deceased?</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000;" data-field="name_2">{{ name_2 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section" style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10px; text-align: center;">
    <p>Please mail this form to: OHSU Foundation, P.O. Box <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>, Portland, OR <span data-field="postal_code">{{ postal_code }}</span></p>
    <p>To make a gift online, please visit <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span>.</p>
    <p>Contact us at <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>.</p>
    <p>The OHSU and Development Foundations are 501(c)(3) non-profit organizations. Federal ID Number 23-7083114 (OHSUF) and 93-0579589 (DCHF). Contributions are tax-deductible to the fullest extent allowed by law. OHSU is an equal opportunity, affirmative action institution. 11/19</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 10px;">KNIB15QMG</p>
  </div>
</div>